1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,981
Remember the permanganate titration from Unit 1?

2
00:00:02,981 --> 00:00:08,372
The first drops lose their colour slowly, the rest almost instantly.

3
00:00:08,372 --> 00:00:14,036
The manganese two plus ions produced catalyse the reaction itself.

4
00:00:14,036 --> 00:00:18,554
That is autocatalysis, and it is why we warm the flask to get started.

